        <p>ARMITAGE AND RMAIV. mitage and Righy's was ell-street Tannery, who, i were 40 chalks ahead st they would have to use they ran home by the thingo they had learnt Owen (Tannery captain) owers by soundly thresh- other of the Cemeteiy keen game, th .ugh beaten by no fewer 3 misleading. The jack 7 seldom did the woods r character was indulged I) and C. Lunt, the latter game throughout wan an struggle between P. (ter it may be raid that result in doubt. Carter The former then made ,hin • point of victory, irei, with creditable 'it ion and it was thought • making a break or 8 thus ran home by 2</p>
