        <p>The resolution' was then put to the meeting and carried unanimously. Mr. IlArtrtv Ng,- said that that meeting 1V,4 the commencement of. very seldoma business in Warrington They had put their bands to the wheel of progress and they were going to triumph, deapite the power of the vested intereets which were, he wn• lorry to say, too clearly allied to the Established Church. Mr. New, after referring to the discreditable display of the Teri.. on tie previous Mendny, remarLed that the member for Wertington spent his time in Trn</p>
