        <p>The abselce of Roy ilty threw a cloud over th's Society fistaie •••• y ...a ma the famous yachtirg regatta is of swim sing brilliance. Crafts of all sizes and sorts were on the seat r. The, e were racing yachts, with the flags of all nations at the mastheads. There was the King's Yacht, the "Victoria and Albert," from which the Royal party watched the races, the largest and most striking of the many palatial steam yachts in the roadstead. Our Picture shows the German Emperor's famous yacht "Meteor." The King of Spain raced his own yacht, the " Hispania," and was wildly cheered by the people.</p>
